{"title":"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An equivalent of the expression\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1a697fa197389f05875cf1b07ed17480323ffe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{x^2+1}{x}\\right)\\left(\\frac{y^2+1}{y}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{x^2-1}{y}\\right)\\left(\\frac{y^2-1}{x}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"340\" height=\"43\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/b/2eb93e68d5c81f7cc2fda2970ff92eccc3f1b92f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy \\not= 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />,\n</p><p>is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/9/7693a80e829c4709cec25efe13219d347aef6db9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ 2xy\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ 2x^2y^2+2\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ 2xy+\\frac{2}{xy}\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{2x}{y}+\\frac{2y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"540\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/b/a1b4279ca397d69d7acef9577c40a8bb5686a49b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{x^2+1}{x}\\right)\\left(\\frac{y^2+1}{y}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{x^2-1}{y}\\right)\\left(\\frac{y^2-1}{x}\\right)\\]\" width=\"337\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/7/867a2ec89a5cd57d9f19a5a16f15c73a35cd2e5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(x^2+1)(y^2+1)}{xy} + \\frac{(x^2-1)(y^2-1)}{xy}\\]\" width=\"278\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/7112a42f609bd7c20b063d681bd2dfc3b3c4d15a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(x^2y^2+x^2+y^2+1) + (x^2y^2-x^2-y^2+1)}{xy}\\]\" width=\"341\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd946c9695f025b8d6f36f3d68b7441be6f36c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^2y^2+x^2+y^2+1 + x^2y^2-x^2-y^2+1}{xy}\\]\" width=\"313\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f55750a9b528886e3ac3c562a4be28def0b33f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2x^2y^2+2}{xy}\\]\" width=\"75\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0efca0fb726b28157242c21b8aac1b73c207ef3a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2x^2y^2}{xy} + \\frac{2}{xy}\\]\" width=\"90\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/8/438284aa67a3a3f2562df57491abc44d859e4480.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2xy * xy}{xy} + \\frac{2}{xy}\\]\" width=\"112\" height=\"40\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d0392a6dace7686540219240f99918b1f0d9dfe1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2xy + \\frac{2}{xy}\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"40\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The denominator before simplification is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />. As the constant term will not be divisible by the denominator, we inspect that the fraction with only the constant term in the numerator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/059fad07dd87e56dee2e466790814bc88eedca02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(1 \\cdot 1) + (-1 \\cdot -1)}{xy}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"147\" height=\"44\" />. The only answer choice that matches this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n~megaboy6679\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME\" title=\"1967 AHSME\">1967 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1967 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1967\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a h